      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Recall closed
Frequency: Per recall event
Volume: One audit file per recall
Owner: Records Manager
Participants: Records Mgr, Product Safety, Legal, Compliance
Source: workflow W3014 — Recall Records Retention, Documentation &amp; Audit File</bpmn:documentation>
