      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3014_Task5" name="Records Mgr assembles recall audit file: decision records, regulator filings…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Records Mgr assembles recall audit file: decision records, regulator filings, notifications, retrieval/delivery logs, destruction certificates, CAPA, close-out
Responsible (R): Records Manager
Accountable (A): Product Safety &amp; Compliance Manager
Duration: Per recall</bpmn:documentation>
